description=More ammunition for Guns of Marz, all real loads of 1993: subsonic, hollow point, soft point, steel core, +P and +P+ rounds, birdshot and the AS VAL's SP-6. Adjusted gun sounds, full metal jacket rifle rounds pierce, the break-action shotguns' stocks can be sawn off to fit a holster, an AWC Mk9 suppressor for the MP5 and the Uzis, the Uzi, Mini Uzi and Micro Uzi, a short SMG stance of their own for the Uzi, Mini Uzi, MP5K and MP7 (beta), and the M249 light machine gun; optionally Guns of Marz's guns drawn to scale with the character and each other (beta); belt-fed guns (the M249 and the M60) now need belt links, found or made. With Ammo Maker, every new round can be made. Needs Gunworks-gang and Guns of Marz.
